{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>THIS GAME CONTAINS A TRANS MALE CHARACTER</i></strong><i>. If you can't accept the fact we have ONE trans male guy in this game when we have a universe with more than 50 cisgender ones, get another game. If you can't accept it at all, you are not welcome here. Plus, you can support other gay studios that are only interested in getting your money instead of making a better world. Male Doll is a brand about creating something meaningful for Queer community; we make games that connect with our experiences, and we want to be honest about that. We support trans people; we have trans people on our team, so don't waste our time sending negative reviews only about this representation. That isn't a critique; it's transphobia.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874780/extras/803ca5de3571d551aa1b7e18fb479267.avif?t=1768891531\" width=1560 height=336 /></span><strong>Doll Defenders</strong> is an <strong>action tower defense game</strong> in the <strong>Male Doll multiverse</strong> where you must <strong>protect the sacred statue</strong> from monsters, all while meeting heroes and unlocking NSFW scenes/animations on your way to the final boss. Prepare for a <strong>unique and fun</strong> gameplay mechanic that introduces players to some members of our cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874780/extras/5ef9dd023f637f17cf3a31beb10c738d.avif?t=1768891531\" width=1560 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874780/extras/7b33e5db64a5d2328e7d7282c18b8e54.webp?t=1768891531\" width=17 height=18 /></span>3 different worlds with 15 levels and 78 waves to fight! </p><p class=\"bb_paragrap